WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.012
You didn't start your business

2
00:00:06.032 --> 00:00:07.720
to chase paperwork at night.

3
00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.150
Quorra Dispatch lets you quote, schedule

4
00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.980
send the crew, and get paid.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.410
All from one app.

6
00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:15.560
When someone fills out

7
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.060
the form on your website

8
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.370
it lands right on your leads board.

9
00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:20.740
You'll see who needs a call back

10
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.920
and what each job is worth.

11
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.950
Build a quote from your price book.

12
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:29.000
Then send it by link, text, or PDF.

13
00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.430
Your customer can approve it

14
00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:32.410
and pick a time on their own.

15
00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:34.780
Booked jobs fill your calendar

16
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.840
with every tech assigned.

17
00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:38.990
So the whole crew knows where to be.

18
00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:42.220
On the road, your tech taps On my way

19
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.620
to text the customer.

20
00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:44.890
Then checks in on arrival

21
00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.630
and starts the job.

22
00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:48.760
When the work is done

23
00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:50.520
take a card on the spot.

24
00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:52.990
Show a QR code for the customer to scan

25
00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:54.830
or text them the link.

26
00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.040
And the invoice is marked paid.

27
00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.470
You also get recurring service plans

28
00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:02.850
timesheets, and a customer portal.

29
00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:04.280
Where clients can review quotes

30
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.060
and pay invoices.

31
00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:09.290
Plans start at $80 a month.

32
00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:10.990
And monthly plans get half off

33
00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:12.770
for the first three months.

34
00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:15.390
Start your 14-day free trial today.
